{"story":{"id":"story-c33f68f8137e810d","title":{"zh":"谍报失误","en":"Espionage Blunder"},"category":"society","image":"art/90bcb3eb7885cac6a169.webp","start":"first_contact.1140","chapters":1,"nodes":1,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"[This.ContactCountry.GetName]的活动持续的时间远超预期。\n\n[This.Owner.GetEnvoy][This.Leader.GetName]的太空梭返回时汇报了任务失败。\n\n在活动过程中，主办方找到了谍报装置。[This.Owner.GetEnvoyCap][This.Leader.GetName]遭到了审问和训斥，并被遣返。通过后备间谍科技获取的数据，我们现在理解了他们的语言和科技，然而我们的外交前景一片渺茫。","en":"The [This.ContactCountry.GetName]'s event lasted much longer than expected.\n\nWhen [This.Owner.GetEnvoy] [This.Leader.GetName]'s shuttle returned, they reported that the operation failed.\n\nDuring the event, the hosts found an espionage device. [This.Owner.GetEn"},"navigation":{"order":["first_contact.1140"],"tree":[{"id":"first_contact.1140","parent":null,"depth":0,"kind":"reading","label":{"zh":"","en":""}}],"links":[]}},"chapters":[{"id":"first_contact.1140","title":{"zh":"谍报失误","en":"Espionage Blunder"},"texts":[{"zh":"[This.ContactCountry.GetName]的活动持续的时间远超预期。\n\n[This.Owner.GetEnvoy][This.Leader.GetName]的太空梭返回时汇报了任务失败。\n\n在活动过程中，主办方找到了谍报装置。[This.Owner.GetEnvoyCap][This.Leader.GetName]遭到了审问和训斥，并被遣返。通过后备间谍科技获取的数据，我们现在理解了他们的语言和科技，然而我们的外交前景一片渺茫。","en":"The [This.ContactCountry.GetName]'s event lasted much longer than expected.\n\nWhen [This.Owner.GetEnvoy] [This.Leader.GetName]'s shuttle returned, they reported that the operation failed.\n\nDuring the event, the hosts found an espionage device. [This.Owner.GetEnvoyCap] [This.Leader.GetName] was interrogated, scolded and then asked to leave. Using the data from the back-up spy tech, we now understand their language and technology, although our diplomatic future will start on rocky ground."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":"art/90bcb3eb7885cac6a169.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"真不幸。","en":"Unfortunate."},"conditional":false,"next":[]}],"next":[{"target":"first_contact.1100","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"kind":"event","story"